      "title": "gSASRec — IJCAI 2024 extended abstract",
      "link": "https://www.ijcai.org/proceedings/2024/0939.pdf",
      "contributions": [
        "Combines multiple negatives with generalized BCE to address sampling-induced overconfidence."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "Additional negatives increase computation and memory; gains on these four datasets remain unverified."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "TGCL4SR",
      "link": "https://ojs.aaai.org/index.php/AAAI/article/view/28789",
      "contributions": [
        "Combines global temporal transition graphs with local sequence encoding."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "Does not establish that simple transition-score fusion improves this baseline or identifies true complementarity."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "ReZero is All You Need: Fast Convergence at Large Depth",
      "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.04887",
      "contributions": [
        "Uses learnable zero-initialized residual scalars to obtain identity mappings at initialization."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "The original Transformer also changes normalization; adopting it wholesale would confound the proposed branch experiment.",
        "A disabled branch initially receives zero branch-weight gradients."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "On Layer Normalization in the Transformer Architecture",
      "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.04745",
      "contributions": [
        "Analyzes consequences of normalization placement in Transformers."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "Does not directly evaluate the proposed recommender; exact baseline preservation follows from the residual formula."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Hierarchical Gating Networks for Sequential Recommendation",
      "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1906.09217",
      "contributions": [
        "Combines feature gating, instance gating, and item–item interactions.",
        "Provides aggregation and component ablations relevant to control design."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "Does not establish that adaptive recent/full SASRec fusion outperforms tuned fixed fusion here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "LS4SRec",
      "link": "https://doi.org/10.1145/3723173",
      "contributions": [
        "Uses recent-item embedding averages as a short-term supervision target."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "This use does not prove standalone ranking gains from recent averaging."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "On Sampled Metrics for Item Recommendation",
      "link": "https://research.google/pubs/on-sampled-metrics-for-item-recommendation/",
      "contributions": [
